   "titulo": "Ask where someone is from",
   "texto": [
    "Hvor kommer du fra? means «Where are you from?». The answer follows the normal order: subject + verb + fra + country.",
    "The names of countries begin with capital; the Gentiles are written with tiny. Gentilice is usually the same for men and women: norsk, spansk, svensk."
